body:
> When you say "any tags" do you genuinely believe any element can and should be allowed in an `<option>` and/or `<select>`? As in, would this construct be legal?

We discussed this in OpenUI here, and the conclusion as I understand it was to allow anything to be parsed/rendered like normal content, but emit console messages showing why it is not correct for accessibility: https://github.com/openui/open-ui/issues/540

@scottaohara do you have any additional thoughts on this topic?
